  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tchaourou Market &amp; Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will increase the groups members incomes by attracting more buyers to the Tchaourou market. Unlike the more traditional cattle market system, Tchaourou will play an important mediation role for fair negotiation and enable direct contact between the individual buyers and sellers. This self-managed market approach puts the herders themselves in direct management and control of their resources for the benefit of the larger community.</narrative>
  </description>
